1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
I overslept and missed the bus. My bad.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I misheard you. Did you say the appointment was tomorrow?

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I overheard them talking about the new schedule.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
She withheld the details until she had more evidence.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
We outgrew that apartment when the twins were born.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
He withdrew his application and rethought his plans.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
I'm hangry. Can we call it a day and get dinner?

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
No biggie. I took a screenshot before the page closed.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Long story short, they left me out of the loop.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Cut to the chase. Did she walk out on him?

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
I was caught off guard when she brought it up.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Spoiler alert. We stayed up to binge-watch the whole season.

13
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
That plot twist was good, but the ending felt underwhelming.

14
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Unmute your microphone. We can't hear a thing.

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:00,000
I overpaid for the tickets, and now she's ghosted me.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:04,000
He leapt over the fence and nearly tripped.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
It's okay to be nervous. Take a breath.

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:12,000
I'm not going to sugarcoat it. We need to start over.

19
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:16,000
I keep putting it off because I don't know where to begin.

20
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Read the room. Now's hardly the time to spill the tea.

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Y’all wanna grab coffee? This round is on the house.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:28,000
I dunno. Can I take a rain check? I gotta finish my shift.

23
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Lemme show you once, then you'll get the hang of it.

24
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Run it by me before you send it. I'm gonna be at my desk.

25
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
We could've called ahead. They might've kept a table for us.

26
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,000
We'd've arrived sooner, but we couldn't've known about the delay.

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
You must've been exhausted. I shouldn't've asked you to stay late.

28
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:52,000
I would've helped. I was kinda busy, and things got sorta hectic.
